      "text": "[9:60] Charities shall go to the poor, the needy, the workers who collect them, the new converts, to free the slaves, to those burdened by sudden expenses, in the cause of GOD, and to the traveling alien. Such is GOD\u2019s commandment. GOD is Omniscient, Most Wise.",
